```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start([API Request: GET /trends?metric=decision_time]) --> Query

    Query[Query Time Series Data<br/>SELECT DATE_TRUNC'week', created_at AS timestamp,<br/>AVG extract'epoch' FROM updated_at - created_at/86400 AS value,<br/>COUNT* AS sample_size<br/>FROM sessions<br/>GROUP BY timestamp<br/>ORDER BY timestamp] --> Raw[Raw Time Series<br/>13 weekly data points]

    Raw --> MA[Calculate Moving Averages<br/>- 3-period SMA<br/>- 6-period SMA<br/>pandas.rolling'mean']

    MA --> Trend[Linear Regression<br/>scipy.stats.linregress'x, y<br/>- Slope: -0.03<br/>- Intercept: 5.5<br/>- R²: 0.72<br/>- Direction: improving]

    Trend --> Change[Changepoint Detection<br/>For each consecutive window:<br/>t_stat, p_val = ttest_ind'before, after<br/>if p_val < 0.05: changepoint]

    Change --> Found{Changepoints<br/>Detected?}

    Found -->|Yes| CP[Changepoints Found<br/>- 2024-12-15<br/>- Magnitude: -0.8 days<br/>- Confidence: 0.85<br/>- Likely cause: TBD]
    Found -->|No| NoCP[No Significant Changes]

    CP --> CEE[Call CEE Service<br/>Analyze changepoint context<br/>Likely cause: Implemented decision playbooks]
    NoCP --> Forecast
    CEE --> Forecast

    Forecast[30-Day Forecast<br/>Linear extrapolation<br/>for t in future_dates:<br/>  predicted = slope * t + intercept<br/>  ci = 1.96 * std'residuals]

    Forecast --> ForecastData[Forecast Points<br/>- 2025-02-07: 4.2 days 95% CI: 3.0-5.4<br/>- 2025-02-14: 4.1 days<br/>- 2025-02-21: 4.0 days]

    ForecastData --> Cache[Cache Results<br/>TTL: 1 hour<br/>Key: trends:123:decision_time:90]

    Cache --> Return([Return TrendAnalysis])

    style Query fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1976d2
