    style Forecast fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#388e3c
    style CEE fill:#2196f3,color:#fff
    style Cache fill:#9c27b0,color:#fff
```

**Description**: Advanced analytics pipeline showing time series querying, moving average calculation, linear regression, changepoint detection, CEE cause analysis, and forecasting with confidence intervals.
